  su name verse one request begin stage ob text "TARGET_WORDS: 35-45\nSECTION_ROLE: CONCEPT_INTRO\nFORMAT: RHYMING_COUPLETS\nRHYME_SCHEME: AABB\nSOURCE BRIEF:\n" to name text verse one request be text do
