  su name verse one stage from text of ob of verse one request for name hymn verse one mind accordingto name hymn verse one checks to name text verse one out be hymn section verify do
  su name verse one imagery verify stage from text of ob of verse one out to name text verse one imagery pass be hymn imagery do
  ob name text verse one imagery pass be equally from text false then
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 to name text verse one imagery pass be hymn verse one imagery retry do
  ob name text verse one imagery pass be equally from text false then
  su name verse one imagery guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "hymn verse one imagery defective" be guarantee do

  su name chorus request begin stage ob text "TARGET_WORDS: 14-24\nSECTION_ROLE: MEMORY_ANCHOR\nFORMAT: RHYMING_COUPLETS\nRHYME_SCHEME: AAAA_OR_AABB\nHOOK_PHRASE:\n" to name text chorus request be text do
  su name chorus request hook stage ob name text hook out to name chorus request be plus do
  su name chorus request source header stage ob text "\n\nSOURCE BRIEF:\n" to name chorus request be plus do
  su name chorus request source stage ob name text hymn source brief to name chorus request be plus do
  su name chorus request intro header stage ob text "\n\nINTRO:\n" to name chorus request be plus do
  su name chorus request intro stage ob name text intro out to name chorus request be plus do
  su name chorus request verse one header stage ob text "\n\nVERSE 1:\n" to name chorus request be plus do
  su name chorus request verse one stage ob name text verse one out to name chorus request be plus do
  su name chorus echo stage from text of ob of chorus request for name hymn chorus mind accordingto name hymn chorus checks to name text chorus echo out be hymn section verify do
  ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name chorus echo out to name text chorus echo clean be command do
  ob name text chorus echo clean by wo newline to name vec text chorus echo vec be distribute do
