  su name hymn out begin stage ob text quoted.text.[intro]
.text.quoted to name text hymn out be text do
  su name hymn out intro stage ob name text intro out to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out verse one header stage ob text quoted.text.

[verse 1]
.text.quoted to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out verse one stage ob name text verse one out to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out chorus one header stage ob text quoted.text.

[chorus]
.text.quoted to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out chorus one stage ob name text chorus out to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out verse two header stage ob text quoted.text.

[verse 2]
.text.quoted to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out verse two stage ob name text verse two out to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out chorus two header stage ob text quoted.text.

[chorus]
.text.quoted to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out chorus two stage ob name text chorus out to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out bridge header stage ob text quoted.text.

[bridge]
.text.quoted to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out bridge stage ob name text bridge out to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out chorus three header stage ob text quoted.text.

[chorus]
.text.quoted to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out chorus three stage ob name text final chorus out to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out outro header stage ob text quoted.text.

[outro]
.text.quoted to name hymn out be plus do
  su name hymn out outro stage ob name text outro out to name hymn out be plus do
  ob text "node command/normalize_escaped_newlines.mjs" fromtext name hymn out to name text hymn out be command do
  su name hymn total hook verify stage be verify as wo phrase count atleast num 3 atmost num 12 from name text hymn out with name text hook out to name map hymn total hook verify do
  ob text of pass of hymn total hook verify to name text hymn total hook pass be text do
  ob name text hymn total hook pass be equally from text false then
  su name hymn total hook guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "hymn hook repetition defective" be guarantee do

  su name hymn out ret
prah

